1
00:00:00,169 --> 00:00:01,407
strawberries
草莓

2
00:00:01,409 --> 00:00:03,287
i love eating strawberries
我喜欢吃草莓

3
00:00:03,289 --> 00:00:05,330
they are sweet and juicy
它们又甜又多汁

4
00:00:05,569 --> 00:00:09,609
strawberries are red and have small seeds on the outside
草莓是红色的，外面有小种子

5
00:00:09,728 --> 00:00:12,449
my mom buys fresh strawberries from the market
我妈妈从市场上买新鲜草莓

6
00:00:12,648 --> 00:00:15,009
