有时我们做草莓冰沙

7
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:18,210
i also like to eat strawberries with yogurt
我也喜欢吃草莓配酸奶

8
00:00:18,489 --> 00:00:20,820
strawberries are very healthy and good for you
草莓很健康对你有好处

9
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,442
they make me feel happy and full of energy
他们让我感到快乐和充满活力

